        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=Based on the following proposed goal to achieve: ‘{{ $json[\"goal_description\"] }}’, generate 5 categories that are directly related. These have to be categories in the form of goals. Provide 5 specific goals that are actionable and measurable. For example: 10% increase in sales, Increase Profit Margin by 20%, Lower CAC by 30%. Ensure each item is 25 characters or less and closely tied to the proposed goal.\n\nThe output must be a JSON File, we need show for each identified category as an array of elements, each element should be of type string, for output should be similar and mandatory to the next example:\n\n{ \n  \"<category 1>\" : [ <Item of category 1>,<Item of category 1>,...,<Item of category 1> ],\n  \"<category 2>\" : [ <Item of category 2>,<Item of category 2>,...,<Item of category 2> ],\n  \"<category 3>\" : [ <Item of category 3>,<Item of category 3>,...,<Item of category 3> ],\n  \"<category 4>\" : [ <Item of category 4>,<Item of category 4>,...,<Item of category 4>],\n  \"<category 5>\" : [ <Item of category 5>,<Item of category 5>,...,<Item of category 5> ]\n}\n\n\nPlease, omit any introductory comment previously to the answer, go directly to the output, don't include in the response json tag as \" `json ` \""
            }
          ]
        },
        "jsonOutput": true,
        "options": {}
      },
